%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"    StudentID          Case         Objective    Solver     Curtailment_MWh    Loss_MWh    GridCost_Yuan    MaxConeGap    SimultaneousPower_MW    MinACVoltage    MaxACVoltage\n    __________    ______________    _________    _______    _______________    ________    _____________    __________    ____________________    ____________    ____________\n\n    2.0623e+08    \"case_nongcun\"       \"C\"       \"mosek\"      -2.3211e-08       1.8629         28699        0.0022615          5.8047e-09             0.95           1.0623   \n\n","truncated":false}}
